❗️ Today, in the daytime, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation carried out strikes with unmanned aerial vehicles against logistics centres as well as port and railway infrastructure facilities involved in supporting the AFU.

As a result of the strike, the following targets were hit:

📍 in the port of Nikolayev, infrastructure facilities intended for the storage of fuel and lubricants to support the AFU;

📍 a warehouse in Novy Petrovtsy of Kiev region, used for storing unmanned aerial vehicles and components for them;

📍 a railway locomotive near the Dnepropetrovsk railway station, used for transporting cargo intended to support the AFU.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry

